# RideWave Map Tile Layer Configuration (Optional)
# By default, RideWave uses free OpenStreetMap tiles with dark CSS filters requiring NO API Key.

# If you wish to use a custom tile provider with an API Key (e.g. Stadia Maps, LocationIQ, MapTiler, or Mapbox):
# VITE_MAP_TILE_URL="https://tiles.stadiamaps.com/tiles/alidade_smooth_dark/{z}/{x}/{y}{r}.png?api_key=YOUR_STADIA_API_KEY"
# VITE_MAP_TILE_ATTRIBUTION='&copy; <a href="https://stadiamaps.com/">Stadia Maps</a>'
